      "statement": "test_pcie_tlp_template.py hand-builds real PCIe TLP packets rather than reusing src/pcie/pcie_tlp_engine.cc's own encoder, deliberately, so the test exercises an independent second implementation of the header layout and thus actually tests the RTL's parser rather than agreement between two copies of one helper.",
